<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5097" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμέθοδος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not in logical</i> (i.e.
				<i>syllogistic) form,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chrysipp.Stoic.
					2.83
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.132S.
			</span></i>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως, περαίνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chrysipp.Stoic.
					2.87
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>without plan</i> or <i>system,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.21
			</span></i>; esp. Medic., <i>non-'methodic',</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵρεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					10.51
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως, δημιουργῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.127S.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.300
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				50.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
